  { q: "Can foreigners stay at any hotel in Lhasa?", a: "Not all hotels are licensed to accept foreign guests. International chains (St. Regis, Shangri-La, Four Points by Sheraton) always accept foreigners. Many boutique hotels and hostels also have the license. Always confirm 'can accept foreign guests' (接待外宾) before booking — if they cannot, you will be turned away at check-in, even with a confirmed reservation." },
